  "_comment": "Rename this file to basic_chat.json and replace with a real captured Kilo payload.",
  "_instructions": [
    "1. In Kilo, enable OpenAI Compatible provider pointing to the LLM Gateway.",
    "2. Run a simple chat and capture the outgoing HTTP request (e.g. via mitmproxy or Kilo devtools).",
